  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.24,
      "text": "In December 2019, the Chinese authorities notified the world that a virus was spreading",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152094,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.017639
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 5.24,
      "end": 6.84,
      "text": "through their communities.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152094,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.017639
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 6.84,
      "end": 11.68,
      "text": "In the following months, it spread to other countries, with cases doubling within days.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152094,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.017639
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 11.68,
      "end": 16.92,
      "text": "This virus is the severe acute respiratory syndrome-related coronavirus 2 that causes",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152094,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.017639
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 16.92,
      "end": 22.04,
      "text": "the disease called COVID-19 and that everyone simply calls coronavirus.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152094,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.017639
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 22.04,
      "end": 34.49,
      "text": "What actually happens when it infects a human, and what should we all do?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152094,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.017639
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 34.49,
      "end": 40.17,
      "text": "A virus is really just a hull around genetic material and a few proteins, arguably not",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.135088,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00255
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 40.17,
      "end": 41.85,
      "text": "even a living thing.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.135088,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00255
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 41.85,
      "end": 45.45,
      "text": "It can only make more of itself by entering a living cell.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.135088,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00255
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 45.45,
      "end": 50.69,
      "text": "Corona may spread via surfaces, but it's still uncertain how long it can survive on them.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.135088,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00255
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 50.69,
      "end": 54.97,
      "text": "Its main way of spreading seems to be droplet infection, when people cough or if you touch",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.135088,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00255
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 54.97,
      "end": 59.53,
      "text": "someone who's ill and then your face, say rubbing your eyes or nose.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.135088,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00255
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 59.53,
      "end": 64.09,
      "text": "The virus starts its journey here and then hitches a ride as a stillway deeper into the",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109303,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001839
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 64.09,
      "end": 65.41,
      "text": "body.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109303,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001839
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 65.41,
      "end": 69.49,
      "text": "Its destinations are the intestines, the spleen or the lungs, where it can have the",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109303,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001839
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 69.49,
      "end": 71.61,
      "text": "most dramatic effect.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109303,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001839
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 71.61,
      "end": 76.09,
      "text": "Even just a few coronaviruses can cause quite a dramatic situation.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109303,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001839
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 76.09,
      "end": 79.85,
      "text": "The lungs are lined with billions of epithelial cells.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109303,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001839
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 79.85,
      "end": 86.09,
      "text": "These are the border cells of your body, lining your organs and mucosa, waiting to be infected.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109303,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001839
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 86.09,
      "end": 90.57,
      "text": "The cell connects to a specific receptor on its victims' membranes to inject its genetic",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.129085,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.018539
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 90.57,
      "end": 91.85,
      "text": "material.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.129085,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.018539
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 91.85,
      "end": 96.73,
      "text": "The cell, ignorant of what's happening, executes the new instructions, which are pretty simple,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.129085,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.018539
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 96.73,
      "end": 99.09,
      "text": "copy and reassemble.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.129085,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.018539
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 99.09,
      "end": 103.29,
      "text": "It fills up with more and more copies of the original virus until it reaches a critical",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.129085,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.018539
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 103.29,
      "end": 107.69,
      "text": "point and receives one final order, self-destruct.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.129085,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.018539
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 107.69,
      "end": 113.85,
      "text": "The cell sort of melts away, releasing new coronaparticles, ready to attack more cells.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.129085,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.018539
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 113.85,
      "end": 117.45,
      "text": "The number of infected cells grows exponentially.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.107275,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.013634
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 117.45,
      "end": 122.69,
      "text": "After about 10 days, millions of body cells are infected and billions of viruses swarm",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.107275,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.013634
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 122.69,
      "end": 124.17,
      "text": "the lungs.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.107275,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.013634
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 124.17,
      "end": 129.13,
      "text": "The virus has not caused too much damage yet, but corona is now going to release a real",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.107275,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.013634
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 129.13,
      "end": 132.29,
      "text": "beast on you, your own immune system.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.107275,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.013634
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 132.29,
      "end": 136.73,
      "text": "The immune system, while there to protect you, can actually be pretty dangerous to yourself",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.107275,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.013634
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 136.73,
      "end": 139.29,
      "text": "and needs tight regulation.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.107275,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.013634
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 139.29,
      "end": 144.45,
      "text": "And as immune cells pour into the lungs to fight the virus, corona infects some of them",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090916,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.191772
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 144.45,
      "end": 147.05,
      "text": "and creates confusion.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090916,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.191772
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 147.05,
      "end": 148.73,
      "text": "Cells have neither ears nor eyes.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090916,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.191772
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 148.73,
      "end": 153.21,
      "text": "They communicate mostly via tiny information proteins called cytokines.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090916,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.191772
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 153.21,
      "end": 157.21,
      "text": "Nearly every important immune reaction is controlled by them.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090916,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.191772
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 157.21,
      "end": 161.41,
      "text": "Corona causes infected immune cells to overreact and yell bloody murder.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090916,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.191772
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 161.41,
      "end": 166.25,
      "text": "In a sense, it puts the immune system into a fighting frenzy and sends way more soldiers",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090916,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.191772
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 166.25,
      "end": 170.37,
      "text": "than it should, wasting its resources and causing damage.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.124141,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001867
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 170.37,
      "end": 173.49,
      "text": "Two kinds of cells in particular wreak havoc.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.124141,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001867
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 173.49,
      "end": 178.89,
      "text": "First, neutrophiles, which are great at killing stuff, including ourselves.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.124141,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001867
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 178.89,
      "end": 183.65,
      "text": "As they arrive in their thousands, they start pumping out enzymes that destroy as many friends",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.124141,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001867
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 183.65,
      "end": 185.41,
      "text": "as enemies.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.124141,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001867
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 185.41,
      "end": 190.01,
      "text": "The other important type of cells that go into a frenzy are killer T cells, which usually",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.124141,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001867
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 190.01,
      "end": 193.69,
      "text": "order infected cells to commit controlled suicide.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.124141,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001867
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 193.69,
      "end": 198.69,
      "text": "Confused as they are, they start ordering healthy cells to kill themselves too.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11875,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004608
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 198.69,
      "end": 202.89,
      "text": "The more and more immune cells arrive, the more damage they do and the more healthy lung",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11875,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004608
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 202.89,
      "end": 204.77,
      "text": "tissue they kill.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11875,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004608
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 204.77,
      "end": 209.77,
      "text": "This might get so bad that it can cause permanent, irreversible damage that leads to lifelong",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11875,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004608
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 209.77,
      "end": 211.29,
      "text": "disabilities.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11875,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004608
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 211.29,
      "end": 215.09,
      "text": "In most cases, the immune system slowly regains control.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11875,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004608
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 215.09,
      "end": 219.81,
      "text": "It kills the infected cells, intercepts the viruses trying to infect new ones and cleans",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11875,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004608
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 219.81,
      "end": 221.65,
      "text": "up the battlefield.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11875,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004608
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 221.65,
      "end": 222.93,
      "text": "Recovery begins.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.11875,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004608
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 222.93,
      "end": 228.69,
      "text": "The majority of people infected by corona will get through it with relatively mild symptoms.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.100305,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00071
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 228.69,
      "end": 232.17,
      "text": "But many cases become severe or even critical.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.100305,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00071
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 232.17,
      "end": 235.89,
      "text": "We don't know the percentage because not all cases have been identified, but it's safe",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.100305,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00071
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 235.89,
      "end": 239.09,
      "text": "to say that there is a lot more than with the flu.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.100305,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00071
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 239.09,
      "end": 243.61,
      "text": "In more severe cases, millions of epithelial cells have died and with them, the lung's",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.100305,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00071
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 243.61,
      "end": 246.01,
      "text": "protective lining is gone.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.100305,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00071
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 246.01,
      "end": 250.69,
      "text": "That means that the alveoli, tiny air sacs via which breathing occurs, can be infected",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.100305,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00071
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 250.69,
      "end": 254.37,
      "text": "by bacteria that aren't usually a big problem.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.087387,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002253
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 254.37,
      "end": 259.69,
      "text": "Patients get pneumonia, respiration becomes hard or even fails, and patients need ventilators",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.087387,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002253
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 259.69,
      "end": 261.45,
      "text": "to survive.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.087387,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002253
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 261.45,
      "end": 267.13,
      "text": "The immune system has fought at full capacity for weeks and made millions of antiviral weapons.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.087387,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002253
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 267.13,
      "end": 271.33,
      "text": "And as thousands of bacteria rapidly multiply, it is overwhelmed.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.087387,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002253
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 271.33,
      "end": 274.13,
      "text": "They enter the blood and overrun the body.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.087387,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002253
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 274.13,
      "end": 277.33,
      "text": "If this happens, death is very likely.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.087387,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002253
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": 277.33,
      "end": 282.73,
      "text": "The coronavirus is often compared to the flu, but actually, it's much more dangerous.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.113909,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.020966
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": 282.73,
      "end": 287.13,
      "text": "While the exact death rate is hard to pin down during an ongoing pandemic, we know for",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.113909,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.020966
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": 287.13,
      "end": 292.45,
      "text": "sure that it's much more contagious and spreads faster than the flu.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.113909,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.020966
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": 292.45,
      "end": 297.33,
      "text": "There are two futures for a pandemic like corona, fast and slow.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.113909,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.020966
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": 297.33,
      "end": 301.65,
      "text": "Which future we will see depends on how we will react to it in the early days of the",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.113909,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.020966
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": 301.65,
      "end": 302.65,
      "text": "outbreak.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.113909,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.020966
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": 302.65,
      "end": 306.77,
      "text": "A fast pandemic will be horrible and cost many lives.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.113909,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.020966
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": 306.77,
      "end": 310.65,
      "text": "A slow pandemic will not be remembered by the history books.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090017,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003944
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": 310.65,
      "end": 315.41,
      "text": "The worst case scenario for a fast pandemic begins with a very rapid rate of infection",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090017,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003944
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": 315.41,
      "end": 319.01,
      "text": "because there are no countermeasures in place to slow it down.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090017,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003944
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": 319.01,
      "end": 320.77,
      "text": "Why is this so bad?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090017,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003944
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": 320.77,
      "end": 324.81,
      "text": "In a fast pandemic, many people get sick at the same time.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090017,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003944
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": 324.81,
      "end": 329.29,
      "text": "If the numbers get too large, healthcare systems become unable to handle it.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090017,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003944
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": 329.29,
      "end": 333.29,
      "text": "There aren't enough resources like medical staff or equipment like ventilators left to",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090017,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003944
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": 333.29,
      "end": 334.85,
      "text": "help everybody.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.090017,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003944
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": 334.85,
      "end": 337.01,
      "text": "People will die untreated.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.095027,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004196
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": 337.01,
      "end": 341.77,
      "text": "And as more healthcare workers get sick themselves, the capacity of healthcare systems falls",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.095027,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004196
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "start": 341.77,
      "end": 343.77,
      "text": "even further.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.095027,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004196
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "start": 343.77,
      "end": 348.09,
      "text": "If this becomes the case, then horrible decisions will have to be made about who gets to live",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.095027,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004196
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "start": 348.09,
      "end": 349.73,
      "text": "and who doesn't.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.095027,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004196
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "start": 349.73,
      "end": 354.31,
      "text": "The number of deaths rises significantly in such a scenario.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.095027,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004196
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "start": 354.31,
      "end": 359.33,
      "text": "To avoid this, the world, that means all of us, needs to do what it can to turn this",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.095027,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004196
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "start": 359.33,
      "end": 361.53,
      "text": "into a slow pandemic.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.095027,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004196
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "start": 361.53,
      "end": 367.25,
      "text": "A pandemic is slowed down by the right responses, especially in the early phase, so that everyone",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125868,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007576
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "start": 367.25,
      "end": 372.81,
      "text": "who gets sick can get treatment and there's no crunch point with overwhelmed hospitals.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125868,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007576
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "start": 372.81,
      "end": 377.85,
      "text": "Since we don't have a vaccine for corona, we have to socially engineer our behaviour",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125868,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007576
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start": 377.85,
      "end": 380.49,
      "text": "to act like a social vaccine.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125868,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007576
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "start": 380.49,
      "end": 382.93,
      "text": "This simply means two things.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125868,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007576
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start": 382.93,
      "end": 386.61,
      "text": "Not getting infected and not infecting others.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125868,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007576
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "start": 386.61,
      "end": 391.41,
      "text": "Although it sounds trivial, the very best thing you can do is to wash your hands.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125868,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007576
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "start": 391.41,
      "end": 394.01,
      "text": "Soap is actually a powerful tool.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125254,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.088745
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "start": 394.01,
      "end": 398.17,
      "text": "The coronavirus is encased in what is basically a layer of fat.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125254,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.088745
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "start": 398.17,
      "end": 402.13,
      "text": "Soap breaks that fat apart and leaves it unable to infect you.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125254,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.088745
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "start": 402.13,
      "end": 406.73,
      "text": "It also makes your hands slippery and with the mechanical motions of washing, viruses",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125254,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.088745
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "start": 406.73,
      "end": 408.37,
      "text": "are ripped away.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125254,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.088745
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "start": 408.37,
      "end": 413.01,
      "text": "To do it properly, wash your hands as if you've just cut up some jalapenos and want to put",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125254,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.088745
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "start": 413.01,
      "end": 415.37,
      "text": "in your contacts next.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125254,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.088745
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "start": 415.37,
      "end": 420.25,
      "text": "The next thing is social distancing, which is not a nice experience but a nice thing",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125254,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.088745
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "start": 420.25,
      "end": 421.33,
      "text": "to do.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125254,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.088745
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "start": 421.33,
      "end": 424.09,
      "text": "This means no hugging, no handshakes.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.099769,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001389
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "start": 424.09,
      "end": 428.49,
      "text": "If you can stay at home, stay at home to protect those who need to be out for society",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.099769,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001389
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "start": 428.49,
      "end": 429.73,
      "text": "to function.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.099769,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001389
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "start": 429.73,
      "end": 432.85,
      "text": "From doctors to cashiers or police officers.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.099769,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001389
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "start": 432.85,
      "end": 437.85,
      "text": "You depend on all of them, they all depend on you to not get sick.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.099769,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001389
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "start": 437.85,
      "end": 441.65,
      "text": "On a larger level, there are quarantines, which can mean different things from travel",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.099769,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001389
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "start": 441.65,
      "end": 445.17,
      "text": "restrictions or actual orders to stay at home.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.099769,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001389
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "start": 445.17,
      "end": 449.73,
      "text": "Quarantines are not great to experience and certainly not popular, but they buy us and",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.099769,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001389
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "start": 449.73,
      "end": 454.69,
      "text": "especially the researchers working on medication and vaccination crucial time.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.137631,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012817
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "start": 454.69,
      "end": 459.13,
      "text": "So if you are put under quarantine, you should understand why and respect it.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.137631,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012817
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "start": 459.13,
      "end": 461.57,
      "text": "None of this is fun.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.137631,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012817
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "start": 461.57,
      "end": 466.09,
      "text": "But looking at the big picture, it is a really small price to pay.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.137631,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012817
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "start": 466.09,
      "end": 470.13,
      "text": "The question of how pandemics end depends on how they start.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.137631,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012817
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "start": 470.13,
      "end": 473.77,
      "text": "If they start fast with a steep slope, they end badly.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.137631,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012817
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "start": 473.77,
      "end": 478.33,
      "text": "If they start slow with a not so steep slope, they end okayish.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.137631,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012817
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "start": 478.33,
      "end": 482.45,
      "text": "And in this day and age, it really is in all of our hands.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.18457,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.580078
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "start": 482.45,
      "end": 486.25,
      "text": "Literally and figuratively.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.18457,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.580078
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "start": 486.25,
      "end": 490.61,
      "text": "A huge thanks to the experts who helped us on short notice with this video, especially",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.18457,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.580078
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "start": 490.61,
      "end": 494.97,
      "text": "Our World in Data, the online publication for research and data on the world's largest",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.18457,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.580078
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "start": 494.97,
      "end": 497.69,
      "text": "problems and how to make progress solving them.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.18457,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.580078
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "start": 497.69,
      "end": 499.09,
      "text": "Check out their site.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.18457,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.580078
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "start": 499.09,
      "end": 503.25,
      "text": "It also includes a constantly updated page on the corona pandemic.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.18457,
